## Purchase Order Report

This folder represents the Crystal Report used for generating
Purchase Order PDFs in SAP Business One.

⚠️ Note:
Actual Crystal Report (.rpt) files are not included for security
and company policy reasons.

The report is based on:
- OPOR (Purchase Order Header)
- POR1 (Purchase Order Rows)
- OCRD (Business Partner)
- ATC1 (Attachments – reference)

The generated PDF is used for automated email delivery.

